  small-caps">Appeal Heard:</span></b> March 25, 2021</p> <p class="MsoNormal"><b><span style="font-variant:small-caps">Judgment Rendered:</span></b> October 21, 2021</p> <p class="MsoNormal"><b><span style="font-variant:small-caps">Docket:</span></b> 39108</p></td>
