      <td width="75%" colspan="3" valign="top" style="width:75.38%;padding:2.9pt 2.9pt 2.9pt 2.9pt"><p class="MsoNormal">Karakatsanis and Martin JJ. (Wagner C.J. and Moldaver, Côté, Rowe and Kasirer JJ. concurring)</p></td>
