   <p class="SCCNormalDoubleSpacing" style="margin-bottom:24.0pt"><span class="SCCCounselNameChar">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Sean Gaudet</span><span class="SCCCounselPartyRoleChar">, for the intervener the Attorney General of Canada.</span></p>
